          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in Ascot, Britain. And it comes with lots of horses and hats."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The event began in 1711. One day, Queen Anne went out riding. She "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "came across",
            "zh": "偶然发现"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " a place. She thought it was perfect for racing horses. Later that year, the first event was "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "held",
            "ref": "v-hold"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " there. The place is now "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Ascot Racecourse",
            "zh": "阿斯科特赛马场"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Each year, Royal Ascot "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "runs",
            "zh": "持续"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " from Tuesday to Saturday in June. The third day is also Ladies’ Day. Ladies "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "dress up",
            "zh": "装扮"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in their finest clothes and hats."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Queen Elizabeth II used to "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "attend",
            "zh": "出席"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the event. Many of her family "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "members",
            "ref": "v-member"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " would come, too. The Queen’s horses won at Royal Ascot many times!"
          }
